data: {"id": "c3b13041481942d4-thinking-parallel_evidence-1360", "run_id": "c3b13041481942d4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已获得了关键的 describe 结果。\n\n**关键事实：**\n- Pod 状态：`Pending`\n- 容器状态：`Waiting` (Reason: `ImagePullBackOff`)\n- 镜像：`registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`\n- 事件：`Failed to pull image... failed to resolve reference... dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`\n\n这直接指向了 **DNS 解析失败** 导致镜像仓库不可达。\n\n接下来我需要补证 Logging 和 Tracing。之前的失败是因为底层基础设施（Elasticsearch, ClickHouse）的权限问题，这是全局性的，对于诊断当前 Pod 的 ImagePull 问题意义不大，因为镜像拉取失败发生在 kubelet 层面，Pod 并未成功启动，因此不会产生应用日志或业务链路。\n\n我将执行 Topology 查询来完善证据链。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788411104026, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

